{
  "name": "ListAgentDimensionInfo",
  "summary": "查询主机监控原始维度值",
  "tags": "指标管理",
  "productshort": "CES",
  "region_id": "af-north-1",
  "paths": {
    "/v2/{project_id}/instances/{instance_id}/agent-dimensions": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "指标管理"
        ],
        "summary": "查询主机监控原始维度值",
        "description": "根据ECS/BMS资源ID及特殊维度值(仅支持磁盘、挂载点、进程、显卡、RAID控制器)查询该特殊维度对应的原始维度值;其他维度无需调用该接口",
        "operationId": "ListAgentDimensionInfo",
        "x-api-type": "open-api",
        "x-support-sdk": "Y",
        "x-is-registered": "Y",
        "x-version": "v2",
        "x-request-examples-url-1": "/v2/{project_id}/instances/4270ff17-aba3-4138-89fa-820594c39755/agent-dimensions?offset=0&limit=10",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/parameters/ContentType"
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/parameters/AuthToken"
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/parameters/ProjectId"
          },
          {
            "name": "instance_id",
            "in": "path",
            "description": "**参数解释**:\n资源ID,如:4270ff17-aba3-4138-89fa-820594c39755。\n**约束限制**:\n不涉及。\n**取值范围**:\n字符串长度为36。\n**默认取值**:\n不涉及。",
            "required": true,
            "type": "string",
            "x-order": 4,
            "minLength": 36,
            "maxLength": 36,
            "pattern": "^([a-z]|[A-Z]|[0-9]|/|#|\\(|\\)){1}([a-z]|[A-Z]|[0-9]|_|-|\\.|/|#|\\(|\\))*$"
          },
          {
            "name": "dim_name",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "**参数解释**:\n维度名称。\n**约束限制**:\n不涉及。\n**取值范围**:\n枚举类型,mount_point:挂载点,disk:磁盘,proc:进程,gpu:显卡,raid:RAID控制器。\n**默认取值**:\n不涉及。",
            "required": true,
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "mount_point",
              "disk",
              "proc",
              "gpu",
              "raid"
            ],
            "x-order": 5
          },
          {
            "name": "dim_value",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "**参数解释**:\n维度值(建议:同一个instance_id下相同dim_value对应的原始维度值origin_value是一样的,无需多次调用,建议根据instance_id + dim_value作为key进行缓存重复使用)。\n**约束限制**:\n不涉及。 \n**取值范围**:\n32位字符串,如:2e84018fc8b4484b94e89aae212fe615。\n**默认取值**:\n不涉及。",
            "required": false,
            "type": "string",
            "x-order": 6,
            "minLength": 32,
            "maxLength": 32,
            "pattern": "([a-f\\d]{32}|[A-F\\d]{32})"
          },
          {
            "name": "offset",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "**参数解释**:\n分页偏移量。\n**约束限制**:\n不涉及。\n**取值范围**:\n最小值为0,最大值为2147483647。\n**默认取值**:\n0",
            "type": "integer",
            "default": 0,
            "required": false,
            "x-order": 7,
            "minimum": 0,
            "maximum": 2147483647
          },
          {
            "name": "limit",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "**参数解释**:\n分页大小。\n**约束限制**:\n不涉及。\n**取值范围**:\n最小值为1,最大值为1000。\n**默认取值**:\n1000",
            "type": "integer",
            "default": 1000,
            "required": false,
            "x-order": 8,
            "minimum": 1,
            "maximum": 1000
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "查询成功",
            "schema": {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/ListAgentDimensionsResponse"
            },
            "examples": {
              "application/json": {
                "dimensions": [
                  {
                    "name": "disk",
                    "value": "2e84018fc8b4484b94e89aae212fe615",
                    "origin_value": "vda"
                  },
                  {
                    "name": "disk",
                    "value": "6a1b2de69eeb9a037ea23de6b529394d",
